// VS2010 (msvcp100) STL subset for bns-lift: common base.
// The object layouts follow the VS2010 SP1 x64 release build (_ITERATOR_DEBUG_LEVEL 0).
// The PDB of each server gives the layouts. src/selftest/stl_layout.cpp checks them.
